      ],
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Mr. Bunker said the City's public-safety employees were grateful to the Council for the retirement contributions. He explained that the City contributed more than legally required and discussed the effect of employees transitioning between retirement tiers."
        },
        {
          "text": " "
